5. Law Number 1 of 2000 concerning Ratification of ILO Convention No.182 Concerning The Prohibition And Immediate Action For The Elimination Of The Worst Forms Of Child Labour (ILO Convention No. 182 Concerning The Prohibition And Immediate Action For The Elimination Of The Worst Forms Of Child Labour) (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2000 Number 30, Supplement to the State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia Number 3941);
